            "comparability": "Through FY2021 includes Software Integrity; FY2022 onward latest-comparative P&L excludes Software Integrity but CFO includes discontinued operations through sale. Never treat cashflow/P&L ratio as same-perimeter without adjustment. FY2025 includes Ansys July17 onward. ASC606 adopted FY2019 modified retrospective. Acquisitions cash column may include purchased intangibles, especially older periods. Generic amortization-tag scope varies by period; use separately validated acquired-intangible P&L sum for acquisition-only adjustment. FY2024 latest comparative capex 139.500 differs from original123.161 and IR continuing capex121.674: do not erase the version difference or infer same perimeter.",
